        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The outside-view base rate is persistence: this reference class has stayed within 4.1% to 4.5% across the five available 2026 prints, with a five-month mean of 4.32%. A 4.4% anchor gives more weight to the latest level while allowing mild mean reversion."
